%% text.mgp - gucOS MagicPoint showcase (todos/0185): text sizing & spacing.
%% Every deck in this set is ours (not upstream), written against the 0119
%% port: freetype-only text, mono.ttf is the one seeded face.
%deffont "standard" tfont "/usr/share/fonts/mono.ttf"
%default 1 area 90 90, size 2, fore "white", back "DarkSlateBlue", font "standard"
%default 2 size 9, vgap 20, prefix " ", center
%default 3 size 5, fore "yellow", vgap 30
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Text

sizes, gaps, prefixes

%center
%size 3, fore "gray70"
space / click: next   b: back   q: quit
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

The size ladder

%left, fore "white"
%size 8
size 8
%size 6
size 6
%size 5
size 5
%size 4
size 4
%size 3
size 3
%size 2
size 2 - %size is percent of screen height
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Vertical gaps

%left, size 4, fore "white", vgap 10
vgap 10 packs lines tightly
like this
and this
%vgap 80
vgap 80 spreads them out
like this
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Prefix indent

%left, size 4, fore "white"
%prefix "  "
prefix "  " - two spaces
%prefix "        "
prefix "        " - eight
%prefix 30
prefix 30 - 30% of the area width
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

One line, many styles

%left, size 5
%fore "white"
one line
%cont, fore "orange"
 in three
%cont, fore "cyan"
 colors
%size 3, fore "gray70"

each segment above came from its own source line (%cont)
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

The end

%size 4, center
next: colors.mgp
